      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASCEND IGLOO (1) pinged the lids from out wide but run ended and faded out of it late when 5th at Shepparton in Free For All company. Has a good record here at this journey. Rates on top in this line up. ALLIGATOR ROCK (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (28.06) at Horsham behind Mister Manfredi in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Leading player again. DIM SIM OLLIE (2) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at Shepparton over 390m behind Commanche Jack (22.32) in a Grade 5. Should be about the mark. IDYLLIC JAMES (5) must be respected at his pet distance.",
